{
  "feature": "Tuning hub, PRs 1 to 3: the landing, the tool switch, the trim-line shortcut, History and Mana Balance",
  "note": "Tuning hub handoff R1 canvas A (A1, A2, A4, A5, A6) plus the plan's no-reading row. Needs ANALYSIS_TAB_ENABLED, TUNING_ENABLED and PROPOSED_CUTS_ENABLED all 'true' (two tools on draws the hub), on a scratch branch holding a pull:staging copy, and four decks the signed-in account owns: HUB_PRIOR_RUN_DECK, a read deck with a Suggested changes run from an earlier visit; HUB_OVER_DECK, a read deck since built past 100; HUB_FULL_DECK, a read deck at 100; HUB_UNREAD_OVER_DECK, a deck past 100 that was never read. A3, a run in flight on its tile, needs a pending paid run and is covered by tuning-hub.test (the running tile, its elapsed time and the re-read). Mana Balance (PR 3a) also needs MANA_BALANCE_ENABLED 'true', and five more decks: MANA_MULTI_DECK (several colors, a color with sources and no pips; Gishath 904fdc61-e190-4ba5-8e34-2b18fa0584f2 or Blood Rites 783df427-d0c5-456a-805e-cdc94ecb0952), MANA_FIVE_DECK (Avatar Aang 0f585441-203e-475b-be7c-f11e67e20d79) MANA_GISHATH_DECK (904fdc61-e190-4ba5-8e34-2b18fa0584f2), MANA_ONE_DECK (Wizards 7653dec3-bcf4-4045-8242-9000765c7601) and MANA_COLORLESS_DECK (Eldrazi 0b49cb44-8ae2-4c19-b558-633344a2f4ed).",
